message. I don't see why naming something should necessarily involve
writing its name on it. And I don't see why it should be impossible for
an illiterate (or even literate) character to simply raise his newly
discovered elven broadsword over his head and cry out, "I name thee...
Glamdring, Foe-Hammer!"

